    "scenario": "Knightmotives operates commercial vehicle fleets across North America, Europe, and Asia. European data protection regulations require that telemetry and GPS logs collected from vehicles in European Union member states remain strictly stored within the EU, encrypted with keys owned and managed in the EU, and never replicated or accessed outside the EU. What architecture satisfies these requirements?",
