    "title": "knightmotives_automotive: Optimizing BigQuery Cost and Query Speed for 200TB Fleet Analytics",
    "scenario": "knightmotives_automotive's analytical telemetry table in BigQuery holds 200TB of data spanning 5 years. Analysts typically query data for specific vehicle models within specific date ranges (e.g., 'Model X tractors in October 2025'). Currently, every query performs a full table scan costing hundreds of dollars. How should you restructure the BigQuery table?",
    "keywords": [
      "knightmotives_automotive",
      "BigQuery",
      "Partitioning",
      "Clustering",
      "Cost Optimization",
      "Query Performance"
    ],
