      "B": "Transcoder API is a file-based VOD service: it transcodes stored input objects into output objects and cannot ingest a continuous live RTMP feed or expose redundant input endpoints.",
      "C": "One Input per Channel leaves no redundant ingestion endpoint; Media CDN caches delivery downstream of the encoder and cannot regenerate segments once the contribution feed is lost."
