        "text": "Use Google Cloud Mainframe Connector (or CDC replication via IBM MQ / Datastream) to stream mainframe VSAM/Db2 datasets into BigQuery, redirecting business intelligence and analytical queries to BigQuery to eliminate analytical MIPS consumption on the mainframe."
