      "C": "authorization_code requires an interactive resource owner to approve a consent screen; dealer server-to-server software has no human in the loop, so client_credentials is the only usable grant type here.",
      "D": "SpikeArrest on the shared target endpoint is one bucket for the whole environment, and Cloud Armor limits by source IP, so dealers behind a shared NAT are throttled together instead of per dealer."
