      "B": "Anadir replicas de solo lectura a mano mediante una configuracion de instancia personalizada no da alta disponibilidad de escritura: si us-central1 cae, esas replicas read-only no pueden tomar escrituras, asi que las compras in-game (que son escrituras) se pierden hasta que alguien promueva manualmente una region, incumpliendo el 'cero downtime' exigido.",
      "A": "A regional configuration places all voting replicas in the zones of one region, so a us-central1 outage takes the whole database offline; recovery then means restoring a backup into another region, which costs tens of minutes of RTO and loses every purchase committed since the last hourly backup."
